      "id": "agent_hydration_safe_dark_mode",
      "label": "Hydration-Safe Dark Mode",
      "file_type": "rationale",
      "rationale": "Every component must support both Light and Dark modes. Always pair light utilities with explicit dark counterparts and avoid static white background rules on containers intended to carry dark utility backgrounds.",
