      "label": "Smooth Micro-Interactions",
      "file_type": "rationale",
      "rationale": "Maintain fluid CSS color transitions and ensure interactive buttons, modals, badges, and form controls feature active states, clear disabled indicators, and smooth entry/exit animations via framer-motion.",
